---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Home">
    <!-- Hero / Introduction -->
    <section class="mb-12">
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-8 items-start">
            <div class="shrink-0">
                <img
                    src="/images/lekha-patel.jpg"
                    alt="Lekha Patel"
                    class="w-40 h-40 rounded-full object-cover border-2 border-border"
                />
            </div>
            <div>
                <h1 class="mb-2">Lekha Patel</h1>
                <p class="text-lg text-text-muted mb-4">Researcher &amp; Scientist</p>
                <p class="text-text leading-relaxed mb-4">
                    I am a mathematician and computational statistician whose research sits at the interface of statistical learning and scientific machine learning (SciML). I develop probabilistic, physics-informed methods for learning stochastic processes from observed data, with a focus on uncertainty-aware modeling of spatiotemporal dynamics and mechanisms that bridge scales. Methodologically, I draw on stochastic geometry, Bayesian nonparametric modeling, representation/manifold learning, and Bayesian variable selection. My early work focused on stochastic geometry for biological applications; at Sandia, my research has expanded toward physics-informed statistical learning for high-consequence scientific and engineering systems. Application areas include atmospheric science and climatology, cybersecurity, bioinformatics, and related data-driven studies of complex systems.
                </p>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
                    <a href="mailto:lpatel@sandia.gov" class="btn">Contact Me</a>
                    <a href="/publications" class="btn-outline">View Publications</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Research Interests -->
    <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="section-heading">Research Interests</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <div class="card">
                <h3 class="mb-2">Probabilistic SciML &amp; Physics-Informed Learning</h3>
                <p class="text-text-muted text-sm">Statistical learning of stochastic dynamical systems with physical constraints and uncertainty quantification.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3 class="mb-2">Simulation-Based Inference &amp; Generative Models</h3>
                <p class="text-text-muted text-sm">Inference for complex simulators (diffusion/flow models, optimal transport) for complex/intractable likelihoods.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3 class="mb-2">Stochastic Geometry &amp; Spatiotemporal Statistics</h3>
                <p class="text-text-muted text-sm">Modeling, filtering, and prediction for noisy, partial observations in time and space; multiscale and irregular data.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3 class="mb-2">Bayesian Nonparametrics &amp; Representation Learning</h3>
                <p class="text-text-muted text-sm">Flexible priors (e.g., DP/GP-style ideas), manifold/representation learning, and variable selection for scientific data.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Education -->
    <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="section-heading">Education</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4">
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:justify-between gap-1">
                <div>
                    <p class="font-semibold text-text">PhD, Mathematics (Department of Statistics)</p>
                    <p class="text-text-muted text-sm">Imperial College London</p>
                </div>
                <p class="text-text-muted text-sm shrink-0">2015 &ndash; 2019</p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:justify-between gap-1">
                <div>
                    <p class="font-semibold text-text">MSci, Mathematics</p>
                    <p class="text-text-muted text-sm">Imperial College London</p>
                </div>
                <p class="text-text-muted text-sm shrink-0">2011 &ndash; 2015</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>
